    "description": "R. Tolan\nSea Captain Fisherman with Pipe\nFramed Art Print on Paper\nSigned in print lower left\nThis vintage maritime portrait depicts an elderly sea captain with a weathered countenance, full white beard, and sou'wester hat smoking a pipe. Rendered in an expressive illustrative style with warm sepia and earth tones, the composition captures nautical heritage and atmospheric lighting. The artwork is mounted within a decorative antique map border mat and housed in a vintage gold and black crackle frame.\nClassic nautical portrait depicting an old salt fisherman\nAccented with a vintage cartographic style decorative border\nCrackle-finish gold and black wood frame with dual hanging brackets on reverse\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. Print is well-preserved under glass with vibrant tones. Frame exhibits minor cosmetic edge wear and surface rubbing consistent with age. Backing paper is intact with hanging hardware installed.\nUNTESTED: No test has been done to the item. SOLD AS-IS with NO REFUNDS.\nTESTED FOR POWER: Powers on. Full functionality is not guaranteed. SOLD AS-IS with NO REFUNDS.\nFULLY FUNCTIONAL: Powers on and works as intended.\nState Tax:\nGoodwill Industries of the Southern Piedmont is required by law to collect state taxes.\nPayment Extensions - We will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nTrading Card Disclaimer:\nPokémon trading cards are sold as collectibles and are not professionally graded or authenticated unless explicitly stated in the listing. Card condition is subjective and may vary. Please review all photographs carefully before purchasing. All Pokémon card sales are final and sold AS IS with no returns or refunds except in cases where the item received differs materially from the listing description.\nUpcycle Lots\n-\nEvery item we offer has its own characterlike happy little accidents that tell a story. You may find signs of wear such as small tears, fading, stains, or missing pieces. These details are part of what makes each piece special, like brushstrokes on a canvas.\nWe invite you to take a good look at the photos, which show the item's condition and charm. All items are sold just as they are, and because each one is unique, we aren't able to accept returns or offer refunds.\nThanks for bringing a little joy to something that's ready for a new chapter.\nITEMS ARE NOT OFFICIALLY APPRAISED, CERTIFIED OR AUTHENTICATED UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED. IF AN ITEM IS AUTHENTICATED, IT IS BY LEGITMARK AND WILL HAVE A COA QR CODE. SPORTS/ENTERTAINMENT MEMORABILIA IS AUTHENTICATED BY JSA AND WILL STATE IN THE LISTING.\nPlease use the Shipping Calculator on the listing page PRIOR to placing your bid.\nPLEASE SEE SELLER TAB FOR: REFUNDS/RETURNS.\nIMPORTANT NOTES: SEE SELLER TAB\nPLEASE SEE SHIPPING TAB FOR SHIPPING/PICKUP INFORMATION.\nWe are unable to provide details on individual items in lot listings.\nDisclaimer:\nTitles, categories, and item specifics may be generated with the assistance of AI, and should be considered informational only. While efforts are made to ensure accuracy, errors may occur. Photos and written description should be relied upon when evaluating the item. Please ask any questions PRIOR to bidding, as ALL sales are FINAL unless the item is significantly not as described. Most Item(s) are pre-owned and may show normal signs of use, wear, storage, or handling. General polishing/cleaning is recommended before use. Items may have odors from previous ownership, storage environments, detergents, perfumes, smoke, or other scents\n(please note items have NOT been washed) Jewelry\nitem(s) are tested using a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL Precious Metal Analyzer. The Thermo Scientific Niton DXL desktop x-ray lab delivers fast and accurate XRF-based precious metal analysis. All gemstones are tested on a Presidium Duo Tester. This equipment CANNOT determine between natural, lab created & synthetic gemstones. We are not able to test any Pearls. We DO NOT open ANY watches. ALL items consist of used, donated items and have not been cleaned, serviced, or tested for full functionality unless otherwise stated. We DO NOT open or break down items, therefore unseen flaws or imperfections may not be shown or mentioned. Items are sold AS-IS, AS-FOUND, and may not be returned for any reason. We are NOT experts in any field. By bidding or purchasing, you acknowledge and accept these conditions.",
